has one triangle" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186145335} {:answer/id #uuid "2e11605e-4783-57fc-9634-274375ee0f6d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The net of III consists of $1$ rectangle and $4$ triangles" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186145336} {:answer/id #uuid "34b41d98-02a9-50af-b7b9-0af8b6e916d5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The net of I consists of exactly $8$ squares" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186145337} {:answer/id #uuid "59a72f6c-00a9-5e57-893e-f1d95b81d935" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The net of II consists of triangles only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186145338} {:answer/id #uuid "6a9efeff-e4a2-58d6-9979-631509c2e7b8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The net of III consists of $4$ triangles and $2$ rectangles" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186145339}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2e11605e-4783-57fc-9634-274375ee0f6d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The net of III consists of $1$ rectangle and $4$ triangles" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186145336} :answer-field/id #uuid "f2aa6e5e-3ae3-581f-b215-9e0c97daafb7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186145334}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "049160b7-7b99-52f8-99eb-7ab178d7e1b6" :question/math-academy-id "q-61894" :question/problem "![](images/a1/a1cb5b4cb90a334dbbd2ae44d68317680db16ff269b57f51072c7d8e965bb476.png)\n\nWhich of the statements is true about the solids depicted above?" :question/worked-solution "Let's sketch the nets of each solid.\n\n![](images/e9/e9168bf41b10db4e0d353aa09682a7fe048216a0ccf28fd196daaf5bf7fd3fff.png)\n\n \n\nAs we can see, the correct answer is:\n\n$\\,$ *\"The net of III consists of $1$ rectangle and $4$ triangles.\"*\n\nOther statements are false. \n\n- *\"The net of II consists of triangles only\"* is false since the net of II has $3$ rectangles (the side faces).\n\n- *\"The net of I has one triangle\"* is not true because the net of I contains only squares.\n\n- *\"The net of III consists of $4$ triangles and $2$ rectangles\"* is false since the net of III only has $1$ rectangle (the base of the solid).\n\n- *\"The net of I consists of exactly $8$ squares\"* is not true because the net of I only has $6$ squares."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186566261 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186147616 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "7da19110-4b7c-547a-bd79-b4df8088678b" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying a Polyhedron Given Its Net"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "89326dea-bd92-5138-b928-1a6e4830905a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Cube" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186565896} {:answer/id #uuid "9a8d09df-249c-537c-95cc-c1ba4ffc2d34" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Triangular pyramid" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186565926} {:answer/id #uuid "9fcf3df1-8581-5e33-8a79-888452dd1152" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Triangular prism" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186565931} {:answer/id #uuid "ab150faf-4d93-57c4-9d2f-27b46dbd073a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Rectangular pyramid" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186565948} {:answer/id #uuid "e65d907c-5a1d-57fd-8e94-b560140983ee" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "None of the listed" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186566055}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ab150faf-4d93-57c4-9d2f-27b46dbd073a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/val